<title>ISRAEL: Africa Israel Q3 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Africa Israel Q3 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Africa Israel Investments Ltd.</p>
<p>			   (in thousands of shekels except EPS)</p>
<p>			   Q3 96    Q3 95     9-MTH 96    9-MTH 95</p>
<p>Revenue		  213,872  217,111   801,303     559,665</p>
<p>Operating profit	26,791   18,002   100,070	78,325</p>
<p>Net Profit		26,098   25,466    65,100	83,069</p>
<p>Earnings per share    56.50    55.10     141.01	179.81</p>
<p>Note: The figures do not include the results of Africa Israel's insurance business, which is in the process of being spun off.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.26 shekels)</p>
<p>-Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
</text>
